WEBVTT

00:04.270 --> 00:07.440
The shining time...

00:08.570 --> 00:16.160
...I have always imagined.

00:25.120 --> 00:30.260
Something will change tomorrow.

00:32.340 --> 00:38.640
I can sense it.

00:39.810 --> 00:46.940
In a mirage, I wait until you come.

00:47.190 --> 00:54.860
I walk briskly through the brightly lit streets.

00:55.740 --> 01:01.870
You've run so far.

01:02.950 --> 01:10.130
So I felt the air of your love.

01:10.340 --> 01:16.340
Soon after I see you,

01:17.680 --> 01:23.640
my stolen heart beats.

02:11.980 --> 02:14.150
Papa... Mama...

02:14.150 --> 02:17.280
How odd... How strange...

02:17.280 --> 02:18.860
What's the matter, Fin?

02:18.860 --> 02:24.160
God said that the only one able to seal Demons was Jeanne!

02:24.160 --> 02:28.620
So why is that Sinbad guy able to seal them, too?

02:39.970 --> 02:41.220
I knew it.

02:41.220 --> 02:42.260
What?

02:42.260 --> 02:43.890
There is no God.

02:43.890 --> 02:48.520
Maron! God exists! He really does!

02:48.890 --> 02:55.570
Emergency Warning at the Airport!

02:55.570 --> 02:58.650
It's horrible that you deny God's existence!

02:58.650 --> 03:03.990
Then, how can there be anybody besides me, who can seal Demons?

03:03.990 --> 03:06.620
Or maybe God lied to you...

03:06.620 --> 03:09.120
God doesn't lie!

03:09.120 --> 03:10.790
Then, why?

03:11.460 --> 03:13.210
Ohhh! I get it!

03:13.210 --> 03:17.130
Sinbad must be working for the Devil!

03:17.130 --> 03:19.170
What? The Devil sent him?

03:19.170 --> 03:20.930
That's got to be it...

03:21.760 --> 03:23.640
Wait a sec, Fin.

03:23.640 --> 03:26.640
The Devil was the one who brought the Demons to this world.

03:26.640 --> 03:30.890
So why would that same Devil seal and collect the Demons?

03:30.890 --> 03:34.310
The Demons have consumed the beautiful souls of many people.

03:34.310 --> 03:38.690
The Devil wants to take that energy for himself!

03:38.690 --> 03:41.070
You just don't understand!

03:41.070 --> 03:44.870
The power of beautiful souls provides God's life source.

03:44.870 --> 03:48.950
The Devil wants to steal that power and make it his own!

03:49.830 --> 03:53.790
That's a bunch of lies. I'm not going to believe you anymore!

03:53.790 --> 03:57.000
Ah! Wait! What are you doing, Maron?!

03:57.000 --> 03:59.960
Stay there for a while.

03:59.960 --> 04:02.970
Yes, yes! I'm coming right now!

04:02.970 --> 04:06.680
Hey, wait... Are you really leaving me?! Hey!

04:06.680 --> 04:10.480
Oh! You're so mean, Maron!

04:13.440 --> 04:15.810
Wow! You're wearing a cute outfit.

04:16.810 --> 04:18.820
Geez. What is it now?

04:19.360 --> 04:26.030
The letter that you've been waiting for was in my mailbox.

04:26.030 --> 04:27.330
A letter?

04:27.330 --> 04:28.910
Yup. This is it.

04:29.790 --> 04:31.790
What's wrong? Take it.

04:38.710 --> 04:40.500
Nakano District, Mikuri City 5-27-24

04:38.710 --> 04:40.500
Orleans 702

04:38.710 --> 04:40.500
Ms. Kusakabe Maron

04:47.180 --> 04:49.050
<i>God...</i>

04:51.270 --> 04:53.520
<i>"Young Cosmetics..."</i>

04:54.440 --> 04:57.400
What's this?! It's just junk mail!

04:58.400 --> 05:01.030
Tricking people is hideous!

05:01.030 --> 05:03.650
Maron, what are you screaming...

05:05.610 --> 05:06.450
Yo!

05:07.570 --> 05:10.530
Oh my! Chiaki, what are you doing?

05:10.530 --> 05:12.080
Nothing much.

05:12.080 --> 05:13.700
Hey, Maron.

05:13.700 --> 05:14.910
What?

05:14.910 --> 05:16.580
What were you two talking about?

05:16.580 --> 05:18.330
I'm not going to let you get ahead with him!

05:18.330 --> 05:21.630
"Get ahead?!"

05:20.130 --> 05:21.630
With this guy?!

05:23.760 --> 05:26.260
I wonder what's with Maron?

05:26.260 --> 05:27.590
Hey, Miyako...

05:27.590 --> 05:28.760
W-What?

05:29.260 --> 05:31.640
Whose letter is Maron waiting for?

05:31.640 --> 05:32.600
Letter?

05:33.140 --> 05:35.980
She's always checking her mailbox.

05:35.980 --> 05:40.190
That girl...! How many years is she going to wait?

05:40.190 --> 05:42.150
You know whose letter she's waiting for, then?

05:42.150 --> 05:48.200
Umm... I don't know. Anyway, why don't you and I go out for a wa--

05:48.200 --> 05:51.450
Sorry. I've got something to do.

05:51.450 --> 05:54.370
Oh, really? Well, maybe next time...!

06:02.130 --> 06:05.630
I hate insensitive people.

06:05.630 --> 06:09.130
Hey, have you heard that the World Treasure Exhibit starts tomorrow?

06:09.130 --> 06:10.930
- I'm really looking forward to it!

06:09.140 --> 06:13.100
World Treasure Exhibit

06:09.140 --> 06:13.100
Tear of the

06:09.140 --> 06:13.100
Aegean Sea

06:09.840 --> 06:10.930
- Fantastic!

06:10.930 --> 06:13.100
Did you say "the Tear of the Aegean Sea?!"

06:13.100 --> 06:15.850
That's the treasure of all treasures!

06:15.850 --> 06:18.440
I want a pearl this large!

06:18.440 --> 06:19.560
Impossible.

06:19.560 --> 06:22.650
Hey, Miyako! Do you want to go see the World Treasure Exhibit together?

06:22.650 --> 06:24.070
Request denied.

06:24.070 --> 06:26.280
You're not interested?

06:26.280 --> 06:31.530
I am. I just don't want to go with a screaming girl.

06:31.530 --> 06:33.530
You <i>hesomagari!</i>

06:31.530 --> 06:33.530
heso = navel; magari = bent

06:33.530 --> 06:39.330
What?! I'm not being cross!

06:33.530 --> 06:39.330
To have a bent navel means to be cross. Miyako's line is a pun, lit.: "My bellybutton is straight in the middle!"

06:42.250 --> 06:45.210
Yes, yes. Class is starting now.

06:45.210 --> 06:48.420
Today's World History lesson is about medieval France.

06:48.420 --> 06:50.590
During the beginning of the 15th century,

06:50.590 --> 06:53.680
the French nobles were at war with each other,

06:53.680 --> 06:57.350
and the people were suffering from hunger.

06:57.350 --> 07:01.310
During this period, France was in chaos, as the English invaded their land.

07:01.310 --> 07:07.690
That's when a shepherd girl, in the name of God, came and saved France.

07:07.690 --> 07:11.450
That girl was the historically famous Jeanne d'Arc.

07:12.110 --> 07:13.990
<i>Jeanne d'Arc...</i>

07:13.990 --> 07:21.210
<i>The only one who can seal the Demons hiding in beautiful things, is you, the reincarnation of Jeanne d'Arc, Maron.</i>

07:29.340 --> 07:32.680
I wonder if you're waiting for a letter from a boyfriend...

07:33.180 --> 07:35.850
If he's not coming back, no matter how long you wait,

07:35.850 --> 07:38.270
why don't you just forget about him?

07:38.270 --> 07:43.020
You should go out with me. You look like you could use some company...

07:45.650 --> 07:48.820
Let me go! You're not serious!

07:51.110 --> 07:52.990
Hey, Kusakabe!

07:52.990 --> 07:54.530
Be quiet!

07:54.530 --> 07:56.830
Yes, ma'am. I'm sorry.

07:56.830 --> 08:03.710
- Although Jeanne d'Arc became the savior of France, she was accused of being a witch and was burned at the stake.

08:00.250 --> 08:03.710
<i>- Geez, what's with him?</i>

08:03.710 --> 08:08.130
She died a lonely woman.

08:09.090 --> 08:10.720
<i>Lonely...</i>

08:10.720 --> 08:17.470
She was a brave woman who faithfully did what she believed was right.

08:31.320 --> 08:34.280
<i>Courage and faith...</i>

08:34.280 --> 08:35.870
Maron.

08:35.870 --> 08:41.750
Chiaki was really curious about whose mail you're waiting for.

08:41.750 --> 08:43.660
He's so insincere.

08:43.660 --> 08:47.080
He's an annoying guy, who can't respect other people's privacy.

08:47.080 --> 08:49.920
Don't take it like that.

08:49.920 --> 08:52.380
He seemed really concerned.

08:55.220 --> 08:57.340
That's definitely not true!

08:57.340 --> 09:03.310
It is. You get that lonely look on your face because your parents aren't sending any letters.

09:03.310 --> 09:06.400
Miyako, you know?!

09:06.400 --> 09:08.400
I was worried too, you know.

09:08.400 --> 09:12.230
Of course, I haven't told Chiaki about it , though.

09:12.230 --> 09:15.110
Keeping things confidential is a police policy.

09:15.110 --> 09:17.990
I can keep a secret for my best friend.

09:17.990 --> 09:19.450
Miyako...

09:22.240 --> 09:23.950
What?

09:23.950 --> 09:26.040
Because...! Because...!

09:26.040 --> 09:28.540
Man... You're overreacting.

09:28.540 --> 09:30.420
Umm... Kusakabe-san...

09:32.170 --> 09:33.840
Class President...

09:34.260 --> 09:39.390
I have tickets for the World Treasure Exhibit, and well, would you...

09:39.390 --> 09:42.140
Sorry, I'm already going with someone.

09:44.270 --> 09:47.020
I'm definitely going with Miyako.

09:47.020 --> 09:48.650
See you later!

09:48.650 --> 09:49.770
Maron!

09:54.360 --> 09:57.740
What?! You're helping your dad?!

09:57.740 --> 10:00.200
Tomorrow, at dawn...

10:00.200 --> 10:03.910
The "Tear of the Aegean Sea" is arriving at the International Airport.

10:03.910 --> 10:05.540
The treasured pearl?!

10:05.540 --> 10:09.790
I said shhhh! Dad is in charge of the security!

10:09.790 --> 10:13.130
It would be horrible if Jeanne was after it.

10:13.130 --> 10:16.260
And I decided to go with him!

10:16.260 --> 10:18.880
Jeanne wouldn't steal something like that.

10:18.880 --> 10:20.590
How would you know?

10:20.590 --> 10:22.760
Um, well... Just because...

10:22.760 --> 10:25.850
Well, I need to hurry. Sorry, Maron!

10:30.350 --> 10:32.480
Big trouble! Big trouble!

10:33.230 --> 10:34.570
Uh-oh!

10:34.570 --> 10:36.070
Big trouble! Big trouble!

10:38.990 --> 10:43.660
Kaitou Jeanne is NOT stealing the "Tear of the Aegean Sea!"

10:44.160 --> 10:48.660
Miyako is so uptight. She's just going to waste her time.

10:48.660 --> 10:52.080
Hello! Big trouble! Big trouble! Maron, did you hear?

10:52.080 --> 10:54.000
The "Tear of the Aegean Sea..."

10:54.000 --> 10:56.960
...is arriving at the International Airport tomorrow morning...

10:56.960 --> 10:59.800
...and it was possessed by a Demon!

11:01.760 --> 11:04.930
It's going to be chaos unless we seal the Demon...

11:04.930 --> 11:07.270
...before the Treasure Exhibit opens tomorrow!

11:07.270 --> 11:11.560
I've already sent the notice! Please, seal it like you always do!

11:11.560 --> 11:12.730
What happened?

11:14.520 --> 11:16.020
I thought I was going to die...

11:16.610 --> 11:19.400
- Big trouble! Big trouble!

11:18.030 --> 11:19.400
- You're too loud...

11:19.400 --> 11:23.570
Fin sent a notice! Maron is going to steal the "Tear of the Aegean Sea!"

11:23.570 --> 11:24.700
Maron is?!

11:24.700 --> 11:26.700
You've got to hurry, Sinbad!

11:29.910 --> 11:32.830
Yo! Where are you going in such a hurry?

11:32.830 --> 11:35.710
Where I go is my business alone!

11:37.250 --> 11:39.970
It's you and me, Kaitou Jeanne!

11:40.340 --> 11:42.970
Notice

11:40.340 --> 11:42.970
Don't go away!

11:40.340 --> 11:42.970
I'll return right after these messages!

11:40.340 --> 11:42.970
Kaitou Jeanne

11:43.840 --> 11:46.430
Notice

11:43.840 --> 11:46.430
I'm back to continue my adventures

11:43.840 --> 11:46.430
Kaitou Jeanne

12:10.160 --> 12:14.000
<i>"Notice: To the director of the exhibit..."</i>

12:14.000 --> 12:20.260
<i>"I'll be taking the beauty of the 'Tear of the Aegean Sea' today." - Kaitou Jeanne</i>

12:21.090 --> 12:24.890
<i>"Notice: To the director of the exhibit..."</i>

12:24.890 --> 12:31.850
<i>"The 'Tear of the Aegean Sea' will be mine today." - Kaitou Sinbad</i>

12:34.770 --> 12:37.520
Damn! Not again...!

12:38.070 --> 12:43.240
I'm not letting Kaitou Jeanne or Sinbad steal the "Tear of the Aegean Sea!"

12:43.240 --> 12:47.320
Be assured that we will protect the treasure.

12:47.320 --> 12:49.990
I very much hope so.

13:01.000 --> 13:04.260
Hmph! How heavy...

13:05.680 --> 13:07.890
My waist hurts.

13:07.890 --> 13:12.560
Maron! The "Tear of the Aegean Sea" is locked up in a red travel safe.

13:12.560 --> 13:14.140
I'm not sure about this...

13:14.140 --> 13:16.810
What are you saying?!

13:16.810 --> 13:20.820
Well, when I seal the Demon, the pearl will disappear...

13:20.820 --> 13:22.570
Yes, but...

13:22.570 --> 13:27.410
That's wrong! The "Tear of the Aegean Sea" is a world-class treasure.

13:27.410 --> 13:30.450
Lots of people are looking forward to the exhibit.

13:30.450 --> 13:32.660
Well, but...

13:32.660 --> 13:37.620
Besides, Miyako's dad is the head detective of the treasure.

13:37.620 --> 13:41.250
If it disappears, he'll be held responsible.

13:44.670 --> 13:46.840
Maron, how can you say that?!

13:46.840 --> 13:53.020
The Demons will spread if left alone and the world will be destroyed!

13:53.020 --> 13:57.810
Which is more important - losing a treasure or losing a world?

13:58.650 --> 14:01.110
Maron, they came out!

14:06.570 --> 14:09.530
Maron, what are you doing?! Hurry up and transform!

14:17.750 --> 14:19.420
Kaitou Sinbad!

14:19.420 --> 14:22.340
A Black Angel is with him.

14:34.680 --> 14:35.810
Not so fast--

14:40.230 --> 14:41.730
The treasure is mine!

14:43.320 --> 14:44.530
You're not getting it!

14:49.740 --> 14:51.280
You...!

14:59.040 --> 15:03.250
Why, you...! I just mopped!

15:03.250 --> 15:05.250
Stop it, lady!

15:06.420 --> 15:08.510
I'm not letting you have it so easily.

15:11.720 --> 15:14.930
Rather than letting the Devil's servant have it, I...!

15:14.930 --> 15:16.890
<i>Jeanne d'Arc, lend me your power.</i>

15:19.180 --> 15:21.310
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

15:21.310 --> 15:23.310
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

15:23.310 --> 15:25.270
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

15:57.600 --> 15:59.180
What was that...?!

16:05.110 --> 16:07.480
You can't see me.

16:07.480 --> 16:09.730
The "Tear of the Aegean Sea" is mine!

16:09.730 --> 16:11.650
Stop!

16:25.670 --> 16:28.500
Damn it!

16:27.380 --> 16:28.500
Kaitou Jeanne!

16:28.500 --> 16:29.920
Ha ha. I'll be taking this!

16:37.470 --> 16:38.390
I won't let you!

16:38.970 --> 16:42.480
What's with you? You're an Angel working for the Devil?!

16:42.480 --> 16:44.560
Fin-chan! Stay away from this case!

16:45.690 --> 16:47.860
How do you know my name?!

16:47.860 --> 16:51.820
Hi! I'm Access, the Black Angel. Pleased to meet you.

16:51.820 --> 16:55.200
Oh, wait! This isn't the time! Sorry!

16:56.030 --> 17:00.660
Hold on! You're going to betray God, even though you're an Angel?

17:00.660 --> 17:04.620
Sinbad! Who are you? Are you the Devil's...

17:06.250 --> 17:09.710
You are...! You are one of the Devil's minions!

17:13.010 --> 17:14.470
There she is!

17:14.470 --> 17:15.680
Kaitou Jeanne!

17:15.680 --> 17:16.550
You're finished!

17:16.550 --> 17:17.470
Get out of my way!

17:18.510 --> 17:20.510
Get her! Don't let her escape!

17:20.510 --> 17:21.850
Hey...

17:22.470 --> 17:27.230
It's you again... I've told you a million times: "Don't mess things up!"

17:27.770 --> 17:30.940
Clean up before you go!

17:34.780 --> 17:36.700
Got it!

17:36.700 --> 17:39.490
Jeanne, the "Tear of the Aegean Sea..."

17:39.490 --> 17:41.030
Something's weird...

17:41.030 --> 17:42.200
What is?

17:43.120 --> 17:48.040
Whenever I appear, Miyako chases me like there's no tomorrow.

17:48.040 --> 17:51.500
Today, though, she didn't even show up...

17:53.170 --> 17:56.130
Yes!! We finally stole it!

17:58.970 --> 18:00.350
All right!

18:00.930 --> 18:03.390
B A K A

18:01.470 --> 18:03.390
What the heck is this?!

18:04.720 --> 18:05.730
I knew it...

18:05.730 --> 18:07.190
"I knew it?"

18:07.640 --> 18:10.650
Miyako fooled us.

18:15.030 --> 18:18.150
What the heck, Sinbad?!

18:18.150 --> 18:22.410
It was a decoy. The "Tear of the Aegean Sea" is in a different safe.

18:25.830 --> 18:28.540
Found it. That's the real one!

18:28.540 --> 18:31.290
Wait, Sinbad. Look!

18:39.890 --> 18:44.810
Which safe has the "Tear of the Aegean Sea?!"

18:47.980 --> 18:51.440
It's no use. We'll be caught before we find it.

18:51.440 --> 18:54.770
Geez! Who just left these things out?

19:00.950 --> 19:04.080
Miyako Special, Part Five!

19:04.530 --> 19:07.700
The "Tear of the Aegean Sea" is everyone's treasure.

19:07.700 --> 19:10.710
I'm not letting Jeanne or Sinbad steal it.

19:13.840 --> 19:15.380
All these guards!

19:15.380 --> 19:18.550
This wil make Jeanne and Sinbad give up!

19:18.550 --> 19:20.590
Miyako! You're okay!!

19:20.590 --> 19:21.590
Dad!

19:22.090 --> 19:25.010
They actually stole the fake one.

19:25.010 --> 19:30.100
They couldn't do anything this time.

19:30.100 --> 19:33.020
Ohhhh! It's here, safe and sound.

19:33.020 --> 19:35.270
Yes, everything is okay.

19:35.270 --> 19:39.650
We did our job and protected the treasure from the thieves.

19:39.650 --> 19:41.030
Good job.

19:41.570 --> 19:44.660
Is my country's treasure safe?

19:44.660 --> 19:45.490
You're...

19:51.750 --> 19:53.250
Kaitou Jeanne!

19:53.250 --> 19:56.040
I'll be taking the "Tear of the Aegean Sea!"

19:58.380 --> 20:00.800
Damn it!

20:00.800 --> 20:03.010
She's outside! Don't let her escape!

20:09.810 --> 20:11.520
Now, let's hurry.

20:11.520 --> 20:14.100
We have to seal it before they come.

20:14.940 --> 20:17.070
But...

20:17.070 --> 20:19.570
World Treasure Exhibit

20:17.070 --> 20:19.570
Tear of the

20:17.070 --> 20:19.570
Aegean Sea

20:17.070 --> 20:21.030
Hey, have you heard that the World Treasure Exhibit starts tomorrow?

20:21.030 --> 20:22.950
<i>- I'm really looking forward to it!</i>

20:21.950 --> 20:22.950
<i>- Fantastic!</i>

20:22.950 --> 20:25.490
<i>Did you say "the Tear of the Aegean Sea?!"</i>

20:25.490 --> 20:29.790
<i>Dad is in charge of the security!</i>

20:30.370 --> 20:34.750
Why are you hesitating? Do you want the Devil to have it?

20:34.750 --> 20:38.300
Sinbad! Who are you? Are you the Devil's...

20:39.210 --> 20:43.510
Come on! You're the reincarnation of Jeanne d'Arc!

20:43.510 --> 20:45.430
Jeanne d'Arc...

20:46.590 --> 20:53.060
<i>She was a brave woman who faithfully did what she believed was right.</i>

20:58.480 --> 21:01.070
Even if I'm called a thief...

21:01.070 --> 21:03.190
Or a witch...

21:09.200 --> 21:12.040
...I'm going to faithfully do what is right!

21:22.510 --> 21:24.670
In the name of God...

21:26.930 --> 21:29.890
You, a Demon, born in darkness...

21:30.810 --> 21:32.520
I seal you here!

21:33.600 --> 21:35.350
<i>Checkmate!</i>

21:46.780 --> 21:48.070
<i>Collection completed!</i>

21:53.700 --> 21:55.000
I'm sorry...

21:56.250 --> 21:58.330
Miyako...

22:05.470 --> 22:11.300
For billions of years,

22:11.390 --> 22:20.860
it kept infinite thoughts.

22:23.020 --> 22:29.490
It wakens the memory of the distant past.

22:29.740 --> 22:35.790
A life born in the wild ocean.

22:36.410 --> 22:39.210
The huge mountains...

22:41.920 --> 22:48.840
...emitted white smoke and covered the Sun.

22:49.340 --> 22:53.890
It took everything.

22:56.140 --> 23:02.110
On the deserted land with you,

23:02.190 --> 23:09.110
we watched the world ending...

23:09.320 --> 23:15.160
Someday we'll go beyond space-time...

23:15.290 --> 23:24.960
and I'll wish to meet you again.

23:31.470 --> 23:33.390
Maron... That weird old lady came into our house...

23:33.390 --> 23:37.310
She had tea, dinner, took a bath and drank beer. She's very weird!

23:37.310 --> 23:40.640
It can't be helped... She doesn't have a home to go back to.

23:40.640 --> 23:42.640
She must be up to something.

23:42.640 --> 23:48.480
To tell you the truth, Fin, I'm going to sneak into the jewelry store with her.

23:48.480 --> 23:52.160
What?! You're going to be a real thief?!

23:52.160 --> 23:55.910
Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne: My Partner Is a Mysterious Old Lady?

23:55.910 --> 23:59.290
I will take this deceptive beauty again tonight...
